@startuml "Rapports et analytics - Organisateur"

title Génération de rapports analytiques

actor "Organisateur" as Organizer
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Auth Middleware" as Auth
participant "Analytics Service" as AnalyticsSvc
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

== Rapports et analytics ==
Organizer -> Frontend: Générer rapport
Frontend -> API: GET /api/events/{eventId}/analytics
note right: Query: ?period=month&metrics=sales,demographics
API -> Auth: Vérifier propriété
Auth --> API: access granted

API -> AnalyticsSvc: generateEventReport(eventId, options)
AnalyticsSvc -> DB: Complex analytics queries
note right: Sales by period, demographics, geographic distribution, etc.
DB --> AnalyticsSvc: raw data

AnalyticsSvc -> AnalyticsSvc: Process and aggregate data
AnalyticsSvc -> AnalyticsSvc: Generate charts and insights

AnalyticsSvc --> API: analytics report
API --> Frontend: report data
Frontend --> Organizer: Rapport détaillé avec graphiques

@enduml